{
  "$comment": "Single definition of every aggregation (REQ-AGG-001). Consumed by pivot_engine.core.registry (Ibis lowering), the TS DuckDB-Wasm emitter (M3) and tests/oracle. 'empty' is the result over zero non-null inputs. 'merge' says how partial states combine: 'algebraic' = exact from mergeable state, 'holistic' = needs the records.",
